CinnabarIsland_PokemonLab_Entrance_Text_ThomasExit::
	.string "THOMAS: Red.\p"
	.string "You're late.\n"
	.string "Again.\p"
	.string "I was just finishing some business\n"
	.string "with Cinnabar's remarkably\l"
	.string "accommodating research staff.\p"
	.string "You remember the fossil, don't you?\p"
	.string "I certainly do.\p"
	.string "It seemed a shame to leave something\n"
	.string "that valuable as a rock.\p"
	.string "So I had it restored.\p"
	.string "Consider this a preview.\p"
	.string "You'll get a proper introduction\n"
	.string "soon enough.\p"
	.string "For now, I have somewhere else\n"
	.string "to be.$"
